OL,3,AM42 near Birmingham Airport reopens
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M42 near Birmingham
OL,7,FAirport has reopened after a serious
OL,8,Fcrash.
OL,10,FDrivers faced long delays on Saturday
OL,11,Fafternoon after the northbound
OL,12,Fcarriageway was closed between
OL,13,Fjunctions 5A and 6 following a
OL,14,Fcollision involving a lorry and a van,
OL,15,Fwhich resulted in a vehicle fire.
OL,17,FMotorists caught in standstill traffic
OL,18,Fdescribed seeing a "huge fire" after
OL,19,Fthe crash, while West Midlands Police
OL,20,Furged motorists to avoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
